{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FysmULcyNY1795864070.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本和歌山縣有主題公園，成功人工繁殖瀕危的北跳岩企鵝，為全球首例。小企鵝上月底出生，目前體重逾半公斤，預計明年3月與民眾見面。</p><p></p><p>這隻「扎扎跳」的企鵝寶寶周五剛滿月，牠上月28日，在日本和歌山縣白濱町「冒險大世界」主題公園出生，是全球首隻以人工繁殖方式誕生的北跳岩企鵝。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-28-19h04m05s891.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026oZuRlFp1qM1795863985.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.PENGIUN-1830-1_CLEAN_20261128_184612_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202630evktuHu81795863687.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>小企鵝體重由出生時的62克，快高長大至現時的561克，健康良好。園方計劃下月，透過徵集名字為牠改名。牠正由保育員人工照顧，園方指，待牠學會獨立生活與游泳後，預計明年3月就會正式與公眾見面。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.PENGIUN-1830-1_CLEAN_20261128_184612_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fmOcUnX1rN1795863717.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-28-19h04m23s401.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pGy6kKiqde1795864012.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>日本傳媒報道，園方2024年啟動人工授精研究項目，並於今年9月，採集一隻8歲雄性企鵝的精子注入另一隻8歲雌性企鵝體內，雌性企鵝隨後產下2枚蛋，小企鵝就是其中一隻孵化的幼鳥，經DNA鑑定後，確認牠是由人工授精的胚胎發育而成，是人工繁殖北跳岩企鵝的全球首例。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.PENGIUN-1830-1_CLEAN_20261128_184612.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FdiUiua7Z41795863740.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-28-19h08m58s124.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026eyuYcUslp21795864159.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>北跳岩企鵝因會在岩石間跳躍攀爬而得名，成年企鵝的頭頂兩側各有一簇鮮黃色的長羽毛，全球數量只剩約40萬隻，被列為瀕危物種，主要棲息於南大西洋及南印度洋海域。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-28-19h08m23s864.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026iDXeB02swp1795864191.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>園方指出，企鵝人工繁殖的難度極高，無論是雌鳥產卵周期，還是採集精子的時間，授精時機等等，都要精準掌握，這次的成功，亦令北跳岩企鵝成為繼麥哲倫企鵝、漢波德企鵝，國王企鵝及南跳岩企鵝後，第5種成功人工繁殖的企鵝。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T12:23:54.510810+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":540,"images":8,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T09:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:55:55.068924+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T12:17:19.266169+00:00","content_hash":"b2fa3616f12d6d3e15f2c9d4d2aae393bddf5a6397dc34f3155cc424520a39dc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T12:23:54.510810+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}